{"title":"2025 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2025 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">2025 AMC 10A #4</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2025 AMC 12A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:10)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:10)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Chinese_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Chinese Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A team of students is going to compete against a team of teachers in a trivia contest. The total number of students and teachers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Ash, a cousin of one of the students, wants to join the contest. If Ash plays with the students, the average age on that team will increase from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42f9dfd9948c8550bd2c073a26c516049a3f55d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> If Ash plays with the teachers, the average age on that team will decrease from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. How old is Ash?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/e/16e6bae28524195631a982d646e528702af91417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}~28\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}~29\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}~30\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}~32\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}~33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Ash joins a team, the team's average is pulled towards his age. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be Ash's age and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the number of people on the student team. This means that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47cb3d222f32ca54109e6696d10cf74850468caf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15-N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> people in the teacher team. Let us write an expression for the change in the average for each team.\n</p><p>The students originally had an average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which became <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> when Ash joined, so there was an increase of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/d/b5d62dcbc6b6467b5145435a2255adf0100f4f63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> represents how much older Ash is compared to the average of the students'. If we divide this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fc8f668ffc0730528bca6447b71e28cebd0cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />, which is the number of people on the student team when Ash joins, we get the average change per team member once Ash is added. Therefore, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/d/26d1a70cf92008790f1ec40e2ca9f4c3e923b493.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{A-12}{N+1} = 2.\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, for teachers, the average was originally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> when Ash joined. Intuitively, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d8856975da6d0ada52f15c22254dce5d5a7cba5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55-A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> represents how much younger Ash is than the average age of the teachers. Dividing this by the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46c1e0b1bc991ce19e9d0a93374dca1e5b13d865.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(15-N)+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />, which is the new total number of people on the teacher team, represents the average change per team member once Ash joins. We can write the equation\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/8/cb82873483750124c46084fb15267f36082faa93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{55-A}{16-N} = 3.\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>To solve the system, multiply equation (1) by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7fc8f668ffc0730528bca6447b71e28cebd0cf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"16\" />, and similarly multiply equation (2) by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d628f80262665a178ccfc864bfa5529d6349f394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16-N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />. Then add the equations together, canceling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, leaving equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/1/9d12dc66b4d86560bb7f4bcb4ddd9fa790fd17ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43=50-N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />. From this we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac4bc1e272354b8a21af83b5df5184ada6612b59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0750e52c7179e9419973fe37e50bad95405323b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A= \\boxed{28}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"74\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~lprado\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As shown above, we get the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/8/cb82873483750124c46084fb15267f36082faa93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{55-A}{16-N} = 3.\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"37\" /> Rearranging we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae6f8854d11a1027bdb26b0e1b9bc50ad38fd6fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{55-A}{3} = 16-N.\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" /> Therefore, since N must be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d8856975da6d0ada52f15c22254dce5d5a7cba5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55-A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> must be divisible by 3. Plugging in values gets us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0750e52c7179e9419973fe37e50bad95405323b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A= \\boxed{28}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"74\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Another way is to say that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> students and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> teachers and Ash's age is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. We can create the equations\n\\begin{align}\n&amp;(1) S+T=15 \\\\\n&amp;(2) \\frac{12S+A}{S+1}=14 \\\\ \n&amp;(3) \\frac{55T+A}{T+1}=52\n\\end{align}\nEquation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/5845d80bdbf1ac070bf87d3922f033a3a69c9363.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=2S+14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> and equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7505225a2ed186dc4c5790f20847bcc3d4a5bbd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=-3T+52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"16\" />. Multiply equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get equation \\begin{align} (4) 3A=6S+42 \\end{align} and equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> to get \\begin{align}(5) -2A=6T-104 \\end{align} Add (4) and (5) to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6ca53c09024a96ad6148fdc8eff72ff1f13e041.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=6(S+T)-62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" />. After substituting equation (1) and simplifying, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d8fd5ee5d6907467d157278178c390e83f2bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\boxed{28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"69\" height=\"25\" /> or answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~PandaGod7even\n~minor latex by Math1958\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_